# This repository is published. Anything that lands here is public and permanent, so the
# ignores below are about accidents rather than tidiness.

# Never: a customer's or our own report. Saving a report in Power BI Desktop writes the licence key
# into each Zebra visual.json that has rendered, so a stray project directory leaks it.
*.pbip
*.pbix
*.Report/
*.SemanticModel/
.pbi/

# Session and tooling artefacts from the harness that generates this bundle.
.zbi-reports/
.zbi/

# Node, in case the MCP server ever gains dependencies.
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
*.tgz

# macOS and editors
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
